    js .= 'function lockPiece(){const cs=SH[curKind][curRot&3];let top=false;for(let i=0;i<4;i++){const bx=curX+cs[i][0],by=curY+cs[i][1];if(by<0){top=true;continue;}if(bx>=0&&bx<COLS&&by<ROWS)board[by][bx]=curKind;}'
    js .= 'const ts=isTSpin();const cl=[];for(let r=ROWS-1;r>=0;r--){if(board[r].every(c=>c!==null)){cl.push(r);board.splice(r,1);board.unshift(Array(COLS).fill(null));r++;}}'
